cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "ProteoClinView: Interactive Proteoform-Centric Visualization for Top-Down Proteomics"
authors:
  - family-names: "Piñero Roig"
    given-names: "Laura"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-3390-4029"
    affiliation: "Universitat de Barcelona, Faculty of Medicine"
abstract: >-
  GSoC 2026 OpenMS Project C1 proposal prototype. Streamlit-based
  visualization of intact proteoforms with cross-linked sequence
  viewer, mirror plot with per-peak delta-ppm, and fragment ion
  annotation (c, z, b, y; multi-charge) demonstrated on human insulin
  B chain, ubiquitin, and the hemoglobin alpha N-terminus.
repository-code: "https://github.com/laurapiro17/ProteoClinView"
url: "https://laurapiro17-proteoclinview-app-tv7oqq.streamlit.app/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - top-down proteomics
  - proteoform
  - mass spectrometry
  - OpenMS
  - pyOpenMS
  - Streamlit
  - GSoC 2026
date-released: 2026-03-22
